OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry day on Sunday and feeling
OL,6,Fvery warm in the sunny spells.
OL,7,
OL,8,CTonight:FA bright evening across the
OL,9,Fregion, with sunny spells to end the
OL,10,Fday. Remaining dry overnight with
OL,11,Fclear spells. Rather warm overnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FDry, with clear or sunny
OL,14,Fspells, cloud increasing across the
OL,15,Fwest at times making skies a little
OL,16,Fhazy. Feeling very warm and humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
